  description: "A pair of slender vines with small leaves curled around what appears
    at first glance to be a glass container filled with some mysterious fluid but
    is in fact a part of the plant itself. \n\nOnce set on a pot, it never stops
    reading the water level beneath it."
  descriptionSecondary: Attaches a permanent water-level readout to the pot it's
    used on. Its a lasting gauge rather than a one-time effect, so you can check
    a plant's thirst at a glance from then on.
